Haaru
An Apache License 2.0 adaptation of Nrfr's country/operator selection features.
Version 0.6.0 uses central phone-service return-value copies, two non-persistent
SIM properties and a phone original-value shadow with a module-owned natural-update
prepare/commit journal and bounded fresh engine acknowledgment. It has no per-App target list.
It does not submit CarrierConfig overrides or subscription/eSIM metadata setters.

Original project: https://github.com/Ackites/Nrfr
Reviewed base: https://github.com/a5533348/Nrfr
Base commit: 6c05f224dc802d0df952db93a6d2852a91c9edb0
